{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a real case, and it was decided in\nthe United States Tax Court in December"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5280,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of two thousand nine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7480,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kathleen Vinatieri had fourteen dollars in\ncash."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10900,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eight hundred dollars came in every month,\nand eight hundred dollars went straight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14840,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back out, so there was nothing left over\nat the end of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18740,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Her car was worth three hundred dollars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21100,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and she needed it to get to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23380,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The government looked at all of that, and\nmoved to take her wages anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27420,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And she had no defense. She had not filed\nher tax returns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32540,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She knew it, and they knew it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34760,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She should have lost everything she had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37400,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She did not. Because there are seven\nthings the government is never allowed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41360,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to take from you, no matter how much you\nowe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44380,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kathleen had every one of them working for\nher, and she did not even know it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49140,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Almost nobody is ever told these seven\nexist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52300,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will tell you how her case ended."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54920,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here are the seven. The first one is your\nhouse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58260,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to start here because this is the\nfear that keeps people awake at two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62220,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the morning. You owe money, and you\npicture somebody knocking at your door"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66360,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with paperwork, telling you to pack up and\nleave your own home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70540,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me tell you what really has to\nhappen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73460,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before the government can take the home\nyou live in, a federal judge has to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77320,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sign for it, in writing, by hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80220,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It cannot be a supervisor in an office,\nand it cannot be a collections officer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84360,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "working down a list. It has to be a judge,\nsitting in a courtroom, and that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89100,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "judge has to be shown three things before\nhe will sign anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93140,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He has to be shown that the money is truly\nowed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96580,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He has to be shown that every step was\ndone properly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100520,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he has to be shown that there is no\nother sensible way to collect it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105120,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is not a form to fill in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107180,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a court hearing, and you have every\nright to be in the room while it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111500,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "happens. You can be represented too, and\nin a few minutes I will tell you how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116740,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be represented without paying anyone a\npenny."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120420,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about how rare that makes it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123000,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somebody has to want your house badly\nenough to build a whole court case around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127400,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "taking it, and then convince a judge who\ngains nothing either way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131800,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And underneath that sits a second\nprotection, simpler and even stronger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136180,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you owe five thousand dollars or less,\nyour home is off the table completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142960,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With a judge, without a judge, it does not\nmatter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146380,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That door is shut. That matters more than\nit sounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150980,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A great many tax debts in this country are\nsmall ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154860,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few thousand dollars left over from a\nyear when somebody fell behind after"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159540,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an illness, or a death in the family, or a\njob that ended."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164060,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For a debt that size the house was never\non the table, and never had been."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168940,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The letters will not tell you that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171420,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Letters are written so that everything\nsounds equally final."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175220,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second one is your Social Security\ncheck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178680,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are getting the whole truth on this\none, including the half you will not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182600,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enjoy hearing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184160,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They can take part of that check, and the\namount is fifteen percent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189160,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It happens through an automatic system,\nwhich means a computer matches a list"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193260,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of debts against a list of payments and\nacts on its own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197720,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No person reads your file. Nobody stops to\nask whether fifteen percent is the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202580,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "difference between heating the house in\nJanuary and sitting in a cold one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207160,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the part people find hardest to\nforgive, and I do not blame them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211640,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now hear the rest, because the rest is\nbetter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215140,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fifteen percent is a ceiling, not a\nstarting point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218560,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They cannot decide on twenty, and they\ncannot take half."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222020,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it cannot start without warning you\nfirst."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225900,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A letter has to arrive, and from the day\nit lands you have thirty days before"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230820,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a single dollar moves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232980,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One more thing here, and it counts for a\nlot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235780,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where the income is low enough, that\nautomatic system is supposed to skip you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240140,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "completely. There is an income line built\ninto it, set against the poverty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244620,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "guidelines, and below that line the\ncomputer is meant to leave you alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249280,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is only meant to, though, and that is\nexactly why somebody has to speak"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253440,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up, and I will show you how at the end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256620,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third one is Supplemental Security\nIncome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260200,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the payment that goes to people\nwho have almost nothing left."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264320,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the one they cannot touch at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267020,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They cannot take fifteen percent of it,\nthey cannot take one dollar of it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271360,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they cannot ever take any of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273900,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about how strange that is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275780,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the same government and the same\nperson, but two different checks, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280560,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of them they can reach into while the\nother they cannot go near."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284700,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody ever sits an older person down and\nexplains the difference, so people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289940,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "assume the worst about both and stop\nopening their letters altogether."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294700,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is how a small problem turns into a\nvery large one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299660,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If Supplemental Security Income is what\nyou live on, that money is yours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304820,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does not matter what you owe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306640,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does not matter how old the debt is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309860,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fourth one is a set amount out of\nevery payment you get."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314480,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When money is being pulled out of a\npayment, they are not allowed to take all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318580,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of it. An amount has to be left behind for\nyou, every single time, and that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324120,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "floor is written into the law."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326680,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody in an office gets to decide it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329200,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is worked out from the standard\ndeduction, spread across your pay periods,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333340,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the exact figure depends on your own\nsituation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337660,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What matters is that the floor is there,\nthat it cannot be argued away, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342220,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that no collections officer anywhere has\nthe power to go below it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346540,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somebody put that floor there on purpose,\na long time ago, so that collecting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351180,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a debt could never be the thing that\nfinished a person off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354920,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fifth one is your furniture and the\nthings inside your home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359360,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That covers your bed and your chairs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362660,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the coat on the hook by the door,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365020,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the fuel that heats the house through\nwinter, and the food in your kitchen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369080,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370980,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Six thousand two hundred fifty dollars\nworth of all that is protected, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376080,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the figure creeps up a little each year\nwith prices, which is where it stands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380300,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381580,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I include this one because of what\nfrightened people do when nobody has told"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 386580,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them the truth. Families move furniture\nout to a garage belonging to a cousin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392920,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somebody sells a dining table worth nine\nhundred dollars for two hundred, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398080,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they want it gone before anyone comes to\nthe door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401480,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of that was ever needed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403440,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of it was already safe. Nobody had\ntold them, and the fear did the rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408900,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sixth one is disability payments for\nmilitary service."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412740,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you were hurt serving this country, and\nyou get payments because of that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416800,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "injury, the government cannot take that\nmoney."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420080,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They cannot take fifteen percent of it,\nand they cannot take any of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424540,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I say that plainly because a lot of\nconfusion sits around this one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428440,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A military pension and a service"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430520,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "disability payment are two different\nthings,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433000,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the law treats them differently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435380,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the disability payment for a service\ninjury that is protected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439140,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If that is you, and somebody has told you\notherwise, they were wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443900,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The seventh one is workers compensation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447020,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you were hurt at work and you get\npayments because of it, that money is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451560,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "protected too, for the same reason as the\none before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455780,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Payments like that are not really income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are money handed over for something\nthat was already taken from you once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463460,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one more belongs beside it, so I will\ngive it to you here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The tools you need for your work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470200,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you still work, or you do a little\nrepair, or a trade on the side to keep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474480,
    "dDurationMs": 4354,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things going, those tools are protected up\nto three thousand one hundred twenty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478834,
    "dDurationMs": 446,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "five dollars."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480200,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are not allowed to take away the very\nthing you use to earn the money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484140,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they say you owe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485840,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even the government could see the sense in\nthat one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488700,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, before I tell you how the case ended,\nI want to give you one more fact,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493620,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this is not my opinion. It comes from\nthe watchdog that sits inside the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498680,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tax system itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500520,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Taxpayer Advocate is an office that\nreports to Congress on how ordinary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504500,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people are treated. And what that office\nhas written down is this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508660,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Money is routinely taken from people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510720,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through levies without anyone first\nworking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513220,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out whether that person can afford to lose\nit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516480,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody checks. That same office has now\nasked Congress to force a check to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521460,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "happen, by building something that finds\nthe people who cannot survive a collection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525880,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before the collection ever starts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528780,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That request is sitting in front of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530900,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Congress right now, which tells you\nplainly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533020,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it is not happening yet. So the\nprotection is real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537160,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it does not switch itself on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540520,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somebody has to raise a hand and say out\nloud what their life actually costs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545160,
    "dDurationMs": 660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to live."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546600,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That somebody is you. Which brings me back\nto Kathleen Vinatieri."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551340,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She filled in a financial statement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554280,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What came in each month, what went out\neach month, the fourteen dollars in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558480,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cash, and the car she needed to reach her\njob."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562000,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The collections office read all of it and\nsaid the levy would go ahead anyway,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566020,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because she had not filed her returns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569060,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So she took it to the United States Tax\nCourt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571740,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the court said no. The judges held\nthat when taking money would leave a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577680,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person unable to cover their basic living\ncosts, the government is required"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582620,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to stop. It is not encouraged to stop, and\nit is not merely allowed to stop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588300,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it feels like it. It is required to\nstop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592240,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then they went further, and said that\nrequirement does not depend on whether"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596640,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have filed your returns. That is\nexactly what the agency had argued, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601880,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the court told them plainly they had gone\nbeyond their own powers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605620,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A woman with fourteen dollars and a stack\nof unfiled returns walked out of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611560,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that courtroom with the levy lifted off\nher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614540,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She did not win because she was clever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617500,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She did not win because she found"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619380,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a loophole, or knew somebody, or hired\nanyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622700,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "expensive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624140,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She won because the protection was already\nsitting there in the law, waiting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628960,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and she was the one who finally pointed at\nit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631880,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That ruling still stands today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633720,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the law this morning, while you are\nlistening to me, and every collections"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639320,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "officer in this country is bound by it,\nwhether they mention it to you or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644520,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now to the part that actually helps you,\nand I should say first that this is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649660,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "general information rather than legal\nadvice, so do check your own situation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655280,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know some of you heard the word form a\nfew minutes ago and felt your shoulders"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659700,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drop. You thought about paperwork, and\nnumbers, and one more thing to work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664980,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out alone at the kitchen table."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666920,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me give you the easy way first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669620,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is something called a Low Income\nTaxpayer Clinic, and hardly anyone has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673820,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "heard of it. These are real lawyers and\nreal tax people who will take your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678160,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "case and deal with the government for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680980,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They do not advise you from a distance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683340,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They represent you, in your own name, in\nfront of the very people sending you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687740,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the letters. And they do it for free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690700,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are not part of the collections\noffice, and they do not answer to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695700,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your income is under about two and a\nhalf times the poverty line you qualify,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700520,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is most people living on a Social\nSecurity check."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704880,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The amount in dispute needs to be under\nfifty thousand dollars, which covers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709460,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nearly everybody listening to this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712160,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every state has at least one clinic, and\nmany states have several."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715720,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ask for publication four one three four,\nwhich is the list of them, or telephone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721480,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Taxpayer Advocate and ask which one is\nnearest to you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725580,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the whole job. One phone call, and\nsomebody else carries the rest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730600,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you would rather do it yourself, it\ncomes down to two pieces of paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735640,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Form twelve one five three asks for a\nhearing, and sending it in stops the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741180,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "levy where it stands while a real person\nlooks at your case properly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745800,
    "dDurationMs": 409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Form four"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746954,
    "dDurationMs": 1726,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "three three F is the money statement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 749200,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What comes in, what goes out, nothing more\ncomplicated than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 753800,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the same form Kathleen filled in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756200,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the one thing you cannot skip is the\nthirty days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760420,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From the day that letter arrives, you have\nthirty days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763960,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After that your strongest protections are\ngone, and every step becomes harder"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768520,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and slower than it needed to be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770360,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Make the phone call in the first week, and\nthen let somebody else carry it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775900,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let me put the seven in front of you\none last time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778880,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your house needs a federal judge before\nanyone can take it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782400,
    "dDurationMs": 3725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your Social Security check has a ceiling\nof fifteen percent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786165,
    "dDurationMs": 3715,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Supplemental Security Income is something\nthey cannot touch at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790620,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A set amount has to be left out of every\npayment you get."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794420,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Six thousand two hundred fifty dollars of\nyour furniture and household things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798100,
    "dDurationMs": 620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799600,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Disability payments for military service\nare safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803380,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so is workers compensation, along with\nthe tools you work with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808360,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Seven things, and not one of them applies\nitself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811580,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the real lesson of Kathleen\nVinatieri."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814760,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She had no lawyer at the start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817000,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She had not done everything right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819080,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She was owed no favors by anybody in that\nbuilding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822240,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She simply wrote down what her life\nactually cost her to live, and the law"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826580,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "did the rest of the work for her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828160,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The government is not going to read you\nthis list."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831820,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has no reason to. But you have heard it\nnow, and that means you can be the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836380,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person in your family who knows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838640,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If somebody you care about has a letter\nsitting unopened in a drawer, send"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843000,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them this before their thirty days run\nout."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845620,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That drawer is where nearly all of the\ndamage happens."
    } ]
  } ]
}
